WIND COUNTRY BORDER PATROL -- RUNNING LOG
Standing assignment | Rotating jonin oversight

This log tracks the continuous patrol of the Land of Wind's frontier and the
approaches to Sunagakure. Entries are appended each rotation.

- Rotation 1: Perimeter clear. Reaffirmed waystation water caches. One lost
  caravan traveler recovered and returned; minor heat exposure.
- Rotation 2: Sighted a Leaf courier on the shared alliance route; verified
  credentials, exchanged recognition sign, passed without incident. Alliance
  cooperation noted as smooth.
- Rotation 3: Sandstorm grounded patrol for half a cycle. Resumed with no
  enemy sign. Repaired a collapsed dune marker.

Standing orders: challenge all unregistered crossings, honor the Leaf alliance
recognition protocol, and report any bijuu-hunter or Akatsuki indicator to the
Kazekage Office immediately. Patrol continues. Filed active.
